        {
          "id": 433637921,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Shouldn't `pinfo.p2p_dir` be documented in section [11.5.5. Pinfo](https://www.wireshark.org/docs/wsdg_html_chunked/lua_module_Pinfo.html#lua_class_Pinfo) of the Wireshark Developer's Guide?  It would also be nice if all the pinfo fields were alphabetized, both in the documentation and in Pinfo_attributes[] to make it easier to verify that they're all documented.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6624779,
            "username": "cjmaynard",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Christopher Maynard",
            "state": "active",
