          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "It should, can you update the regex in docbook/make-wsluarm.pl to recognize numbers in the part after the first `_`:\n```\n[ '/\\052\\s+WSLUA_ATTRIBUTE\\s+([A-Za-z0-9]+)_([a-z_]+)\\s+([A-Z]*)\\s*(.*?)\\052/',\n```\nto\n```\n[ '/\\052\\s+WSLUA_ATTRIBUTE\\s+([A-Za-z0-9]+)_([a-z0-9_]+)\\s+([A-Z]*)\\s*(.*?)\\052/',\n```",
